Package: ubturbo-rmrs
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
         coreutils, ubturbo-smap (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: ubturbo-ucache (= ${binary:Version})
Description: UB Turbo resource management framework
 This package contains the ubturbo daemon (ub_turbo_exec),
 client library (libubturbo_client.so), RMRS plugin,
 configuration files, and the systemd service unit.
 .
 It is the core of the ubturbo framework and depends on the smap
 and ucache companion packages shipped from the same source.

Package: ubturbo-smap
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, kmod
Description: SMAP driver and tiering kernel modules for ubturbo
 This package contains the SMAP driver kernel modules
 (smap_tracking_core, smap_access_tracking, smap_histogram_tracking,
 smap_tiering) and the ucache kernel module, along with the
 userspace libsmap.so library and the udev rule that governs
 device permissions.

Package: ubturbo-ucache
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ubturbo-rmrs (= ${binary:Version})
Description: UCache userspace plugin for ubturbo
 This package contains the Huawei UCache userspace plugin
 (libucache_os_turbo_plugin.so) and its configuration file
 loaded by the ubturbo daemon.

Package: ubturbo-devel
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ubturbo-rmrs (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Development headers for the UB Turbo framework
 This package contains the C headers required to integrate with
 the UB Turbo SDK, including turbo_conf.h, turbo_def.h,
 turbo_ipc_client.h, turbo_ipc_server.h, turbo_logger.h,
 turbo_serialize.h, turbo_rmrs_interface.h,
 turbo_ucache_interface.h and smap_interface.h.
